## Claude Code hook parity (manual)

[`.claude/settings.local.json`](.claude/settings.local.json) runs PostToolUse hooks in Claude Code; **Cursor does not.** After edits:

- Under `test/**`: run `ctest --output-on-failure` from your build directory.
- Under `src/engine/**` or `src/nodes/**`: follow realtime-safety guidance in [element-audio-path.mdc](element-audio-path.mdc).

## compile_commands

Generate with CMake, e.g.:

`cmake -B build-merged -DCMAKE_EXPORT_COMPILE_COMMANDS=ON -DCMAKE_OSX_DEPLOYMENT_TARGET=14.0`

(Adjust the build directory if you use `build-bugfix`.)
